# Physical Purchase

This document explains the procurement procedure.
Please follow the following process clearly to obtain a physical copy of xLaDe:

1. Email us with your name, shipping address (complete address with zip code and country) and required copy.
2. Either buy the media yourself and self deliver or make the seller deliver it in our address, or pay us so that we can buy ourself.
3. Make sure that you clearly mention the exact specification of media and also it is deliverable to our address, otherwise we won't be able to help.
4. If paying to us, mail us for the paying medium. We generally accept UPI (preferred), Paypal (depends), and Bitcoin (rarely, only for non-indian users).
5. Pay for the delivery cost and then we ship it to the required shipping address (we will share the receipt in advance).
6. Get it delievered and enjoy.

Please note that we do this on a volunteer service, and we don't charge any labour or other miscellaneous cost. 
We support the all-India shipping completely, but international shipping is best-effort only due to logistics and shipping problems. 
You are only paying for the physical media and shipping cost. 
In addition, we don't accept any 'tip' or extra money even if user willingly wants to provide.